NAME a field cleared after a marked draft has empty context
PROFILES nstextview
LANG chinese
TEXT "old|"
TYPE nihao
APP clears
# Contract v1.2: right after APP clears the field is empty; the input method must have dropped the draft by the next
# key (Chromium tells it nothing then), so the next key is where that is checked: a fresh composition, no "nihao" in it.
EXPECT doc ""
EXPECT context before ""
TYPE wo
EXPECT marked "wo"
KEY space
EXPECT doc "我|"
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT panel hidden
EXPECT nolost
